    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "London • Rio de Janeiro\nDinner\nOur Well-Being in the Air menu offers you an\nalternative dining style that is light, easily digested\nand low in salt, sugar and fat.\nGreek salad\nBreadcrumb coated turkey breast\nwith pasta shells\nor\nBaked perch with herbs and lemon\nFruit savarin and raspberry sauce\nSelection of cheese with crackers\nCoffee, decaffeinated coffee or tea\nserved with chocolate\nWe apologize if, owing to previous passenger\nselection, your choice is not available.\nBA 245C THU WT QB\n4 16JUL95\n340Y040-B95\nLondon • Rio de Janeiro\nJantar\nNosso cardápio Well-Being in the Air Ihe oferece\num estilo de jantar alternativo mais leve, fácil de\ndigerir e com pouco sal, açúcar e gordura.\nSalada grega\n-*-\nPeito de peru à milanesa\ncom macarrão concha\nOu\nPerca assada com limão e ervas finas\n-*-\nSavarin de fruta e calda de framboesa\n- *\nSeleção de queijos com bolachas\n- *\nCafé, café descafeinado ou chá\nservido com chocolate\nPedimos desculpas se, devido à seleção prévia\nde passageiros, a sua escolha não estiver disponível.\nBA 245C THU WT QB\n16J0L95\n340Y040-B95 5",
      "BRITISH AIRWAYS\n1 World\nIraveller\nWHERE IN\nTHE WORLD?\nThis picture contains\n10 clues that will reveal\na British Airways\nWorld Traveller\ndestination.\nCan you identify the\ndestination?\nCan you spot all\n10 clues?\nFor the answer, see\ninside this menu.\nIllustration by Maggie Kneen.\nBA 6775\nMENU"
